    l "{size=-5}我们在做性的事情，可你却一直说我是你的「小姑娘」……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_d69c1e81:
    l "{size=-5}感觉已经没有任何界限了。好像你真的什么都{i}愿意{/i}做，对不对？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f2595c1b:
    h "{size=+5}所以你觉得根本没有该死的底线了，嗯？！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_79f6c551:
    h "{size=+5}你那个发情的脑袋真的已经堕落到这种地步了吗？！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_c34b035d:
    h "你、你真的以为在我跟你说过我姐——之后，我还会想要{i}那种{/i}事 {cps=25}{w=0.5}"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f6609c77:
    h "{cps=20}{size=-5}关于安——{w=1.0}{nw}"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_913996ac:
    l "对不起，对不起！ {size=-5}你、你说得对。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_4c514ca4:
    l "{size=-5}我……我只是觉得也许那能帮助治愈创伤，然后——"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_c8753510:
    h "{size=+5}你他妈是白痴吗？！不准再提那个。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_368e94f3:
    h "{size=+5}还是说你想再挨一下，就是这样？！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_6c09729f:
    l "不、不、不要！*咳嗽* {size=-5}我非常抱歉！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_d903dacb:
    h "那他妈的给我摆正位置，你这个没心没肺的小混蛋。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_50247144:
    l "{size=-5}妈、妈妈，我真的很抱歉。刚才太过分了，太快了。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_06f6f07d:
    l "{size=+5}啊！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3eb658bf:
    h "看来你还是不明白这里谁说了算。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_90b96ec3:
    h "把高跟鞋脱掉。现在。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_eef2b57d:
    l "什么……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_fa067a6d:
    h "高跟鞋。不然我就更用力。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e79d0e71:
    l "{size=-5}你、你还按着呢。你生气了……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_ba652c3d:
    h "你说呢，嗯？！现在坐起来。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_cbb8c556:
    h "好好看看它们，丫头。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_663420b1:
    l "{size=-5}你的……脚？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_449a17ac:
    h "对，我的脚。你喜欢吗？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_22defce4_1:
    h "接下来的话，好好想清楚再说。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_2b84bbed:
    l "{size=-5}好、喜欢……？我喜欢。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_8c740f4a:
    h "有多喜欢？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_eaf957ac:
    l "{size=-5}很喜欢……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e83aa565:
    h "那就下去吧。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_1ce19c57:
    l "{size=-5}嗯？{w=1.0}{nw}"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f7242010:
    l "{size=+5}啊啊啊——！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_915bfcda:
    h "好了。这才是你今晚真正该待的地方，嗯？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_2520224d:
    l "{size=-5}妈妈，求你了……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_cb9ea25a:
    h "你他妈给我闭嘴。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3529599c:
    h "你想知道有没有底线？这就是一个。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_cb229fdc:
    h "你不许再提我人生的{i}那一段{/i}。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_221a1ee2:
    h "今晚不行，永远都不行。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_56d3f363:
    l "我不会有，我发誓！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_b688b411:
    h "很好。你最好不会有。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_b662fd76:
    h "那么，你打算在那儿待一整晚吗？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e211787e:
    l "{size=-5}你想让我做、做什、做什么，母亲？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_53524248:
    h "首先，道歉。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_26f11bea:
    l "{size=-5}对不起。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_00b1664b:
    h "不是那样。爬过来。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f543a61b:
    h "看看你。真可怜。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_20df72d9:
    h "不过我们还没进行你的惩罚环节。跪下。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_c2da7817:
    h "什么？你又想要{i}那个{/i}……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_52ef789c:
    l "{size=-5}嗯哼。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_bc3b9b41:
    h "不。那不是你接下来要含的东西，小混蛋。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_b304821f:
    h "把我的丝袜撕下来。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_90899bbd:
    l "什么？真的……？不可能！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e81d393b:
    h "你有什么好惊讶的？我还能再买一千双。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_a5af6b46:
    h "你有没有试过自己赚点钱，嗯？掌控自己的人生？真正承担一些责任？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_bde46d5f:
    h "而不是当一个他妈的被宠坏的孩子，老是跟我要贵东西……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_9797fa79:
    h "怎么？我伤到你的自尊了，{i}小姑娘{/i}？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3159c5d5:
    h "看起来你有话想说。说吧。来。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_9b448d86:
    h "没话说？我明白了。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3ddbb257:
    h "我认得那个表情。你骗不了我。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_6ea14c36:
    h "你其实很享受这个惩罚，对吧？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_76b88bf6:
    h "你当然享受。因为你坏掉了。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_2312d193:
    h "你那个发情的脑袋已经坏掉了。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_8c7c70e5:
    l "{size=-5}只是……你的脚好软，而且你——"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f70fbdb9:
    h "好好为你指控我喜欢的东西道歉。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_03026814:
    l "{size=-10}我…… {size=-5}怎么道？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_47e1a5b7:
    h "用你的舌头。那条不听话的舌头。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_eef2b57d_1:
    l "什么……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_fc347bd6:
    h "舔。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_765d18f1:
    l "{size=-5}不、不要。好恶心……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_6682cbeb:
    h "舔，不然就滚出这个房间，别再回来。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_d70738d2:
    lm "我靠。她是认真的！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3002902d:
    lm "而我……天哪，我为什么有点想舔？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3fedad7f:
    h "{size=-5}唔嗯。就是这样。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_eb91541b:
    lm "这怎么会让我兴奋成这样？！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_c75c824a:
    lm "被这样推来推去，被命令，被{i}使用{/i}……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_ca879435:
    h "现在吸它们。吸妈妈的脚趾。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_eb850d90:
    h "对，好女孩……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_c1c8b6cc:
    h "慢慢来。每根脚趾。好好舔干净。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_96ab844a:
    h "两根？你真是个不要脸的小混蛋，你知道吗？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_413e5eab:
    h "大多数女孩被我这样搞到现在早就哭了……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_7cc242a2:
    l "唔嗯……！ {w=1.0}{nw}"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_f3f9c456:
    h "你？被扇、被掐、被踢，却还吸得越来越用力……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_57a37cbb:
    h "一点都不在乎。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_3bf4f4af:
    h "啊…… {size=-5}大概也湿得更厉害了……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_b564ee0e:
    h "{size=-5}在你那个呃嗯……那个年轻又发情的青春期骚穴里……啊……"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_8e586233:
    h "{size=-5}睁开眼睛。你他妈含着的时候看着我。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_90903f79:
    h "{cps=25}多脏的一个小{i}婊子{/i}。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_cfd34f99:
    h "对，你没听错。你喜欢这个对不对？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_1555e355:
    h "终于被叫成你真正的样子。一个变味的青春期{i}淫妇{/i}。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_52ef789c_1:
    l "{size=-5}嗯哼。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_7df4ec5a:
    h "今晚早些时候你叫我「控制狂母狗」，还记得吗？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_40eb0ab5:
    l "{size=-5}呃啊……对不起，我……我不是故意——"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_32622713:
    h "{size=+5}安静！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_048fd1db:
    h "还有我姐姐，你叫她……？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_65d1a94f:
    h "{cps=25}一个{i}恋童母狗{/i}， {w=0.5}是吗？"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e868c954:
    l "{size=-5}母亲，求你了——"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_feae6554:
    h "一个趴在地上、嘴里塞满脚的可怜小姑娘，还敢嘴硬。"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_e71c7260:
    h "让你觉得自己有权势了，是吧？！"

translate schinese hscene50_Lyna_Helga_258a973e:
    h "让我重温创伤？看我哭？"

